thousands of state variables ñwe literally feed distributions into neural networks! In our examples, the
DL method was reliable, accurate and linearly scalable. Our ubiquitous Python code, built with Dolo
and Google TensorFlow platforms, is designed to accommodate a variety of models and applications},
